 drivers/input/touchscreen/Makefile           |   1 +
 drivers/input/touchscreen/hynitron-cst66xx.c | 288 +++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 301 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/input/touchscreen/hynitron-cst66xx.c

